<spell-notebook "reveal theming">
	<header level="1">
		Reveal
		<header>A reveal displays additional content in place of previous content when activated.</>
	</>
	<reveal-tab-bar showing="theming"/>
	<section>
		<menu class="ui-docs-section-tabs" appearance="segmented" aria-label="Sections">
			<item link="#tokens">Tokens</>
			<item link="#themes">Themes</>
		</>
	</>

	<!-- THEMING:  the family's tokens, live, plus how to set them and which themes touch it. -->
	<section label="Tokens">
		<markdown>
			Theme with the public `--ui-reveal-*` tokens: set one on the element, on any ancestor (a gallery, `:root`), or on
			the reveal's box through `::part(reveal)`. They inherit into the shadow root, where the sheet reads each through a
			private alias, so nothing inside blocks them.

			- The two contents are `::part(visible)` and `::part(hidden)`; they read the reveal's tokens, so set tokens on the
			  reveal (or above it), not on them.
			- `--ui-reveal-transition` is the whole `transition` shorthand, built from the delay, duration and easing tokens:
			  set it only to replace all three.
			- Never set the `--_ui-reveal-*` names: they're the sheet's private plumbing.
		</>
		<markdown>
			```css
			/* every reveal on the page */
			:root {
			  --ui-reveal-duration: 0.8s;
			}
			/* one gallery */
			.team {
			  --ui-reveal-delay: 0s;
			}
			ui-reveal::part(hidden) {
			  border-radius: var(--ui-radius);
			}
			```
		</>
		<markdown>Edit a value below to try it.</>
		<html>
			<ui-docs-tokens family="ui-reveal" playground>
				<ui-reveal fade>
					<ui-image height="150" width="150" alt="Avatar" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 width=%22150%22 height=%22150%22 viewBox=%220 0 10 10%22%3E%3Crect width=%2210%22 height=%2210%22 fill=%22%2394a3b8%22/%3E%3Ccircle cx=%225%22 cy=%224%22 r=%222%22 fill=%22%23e2e8f0%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E" slot="visible"></>
					<ui-image height="150" width="150" alt="Profile" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 width=%22150%22 height=%22150%22 viewBox=%220 0 10 10%22%3E%3Crect width=%2210%22 height=%2210%22 fill=%22%230f766e%22/%3E%3Ccircle cx=%225%22 cy=%224%22 r=%222%22 fill=%22%23ccfbf1%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E" slot="hidden"></>
				</>
			</>
		</>
	</>

	<section label="Themes">
		<markdown>
			A reveal has no look of its own:  the theme menu in the header still applies a theme to the whole
			site.
		</>
	</>
</spell-notebook>
